        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia AP-9039, Modern Hexagon Appliance Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Hex Appliance Pull is designed to easily install on a refrigerator panel. It comes packaged with the necessary mounting hardware. The Modern Hexagon Appliance Handle can also be used on other kitchen appliances too. Choose from a modern selection of finish colors. The Modern Hexagon Appliance Handle is available in 12 inch or 18 inch center to center lengths.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia 9039P Pull is available as a <a href=\"/products/hex-cabinet-pull-collection-omnia-9039\"><b>Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Omnia Ultima AP-9039 Hex Refrigerator Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>AP-9039P/305:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AP-9039P/457:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MGR-filigree-detail.jpg?v=1704354535\" width=\"524\" height=\"121\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>",
